611808/profile\\\&quot;\\u003eanniedoII\\u003c/a\\u003e for the beautiful movie posters, \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/reniachii\\\&quot;\\u003e@Reniachii\\u003c/a\\u003e for bug testing, and \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/reverse_polarity\\\&quot;\\u003e@Reverse_Polarity\\u003c/a\\u003e for the horrifying noob hats!\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eLobby\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDoors have been recoded from scratch, you should (hopefully) experience less door-related bugs as a result!\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eTeleport doors to Night of the Noobs I, II, and III have been removed\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe Badge Vault has been temporarily disabled while it undergoes a code overhaul\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eNight of the Noobs IV\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNight of the Noobs IV takes place in the semi-canon universe of TDTNTOR 2. You’re playing the part in a NTN movie, about people who were watching a NTN movie. That’s pretty meta.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNTN IV was coded in the span of about 4 days. It’s bound to have bugs. Report them and I’ll fix them ASAP!\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eUnlike prior NTNs, NTN IV has an entirely new objective - survive! Once time runs out, escape out the front door!\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eIt comes with 4 new badges! Two badges for finding hidden objectives, one badge for surviving, and one badge for surviving without losing a lot of health.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatches\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-3688494-h-10302020-patch-1-2\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-3688494-h-10302020-patch-1-2\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e10/30/2020 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#1\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eLobby\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eVIP should now work on bonus chapter doors again\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eNight of the Noobs IV\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eOOB glitching should now be more difficult\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eSpectators can no longer win if they “escape” using an OOB glitch\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-3688494-h-10302020-patch-2-3\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-3688494-h-10302020-patch-2-3\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e10/30/2020 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#2\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eNight of the Noobs IV\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eResetting should no longer break the intro cutscene\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-3688494-h-11022020-patch-3-4\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-3688494-h-11022020-patch-3-4\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e11/02/2020 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#3\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eLobby\\u003c