or ambience changed from grey to light pink\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eComputers in the police station upgraded from Apple keyboards to RBLOX keyboards\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eZombie easter egg code cleaned up\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNew bubble chat enabled\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter One to Two Transition\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eClient code to disable controls + hide parts of the UI cleaned up\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNow supports up to 8 total players\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNew bubble chat enabled\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter Two\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe armory code door has been rewritten from scratch\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe armory now disables buttons to help suggest the correct door code after 3 incorrect guesses\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe armory code hint is no longer clickable to prevent confusion\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFish obby reworked to be more linear to prevent confusion\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eHole-in-the-walls for the fish obby increased by 33%\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eInvisible team changers added for all teams in case a player misses a spawn\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eLighting throughout the level touched up in order to prevent weird clipping/bleeding on the outside\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eOutdoor ambience changed from grey to light puple\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003ePrison roofs converted from “Cobblestone” to “Plastic” to feel more classic\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e“Noob” nametag removed from the Donut Warden\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003ePotentially confusing key removed from Donut Warden’s desk\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRemoved an unused copyrighted s