na, they can pick it up to continue\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003ePrincess Noob now drops a physical crown again - if a player is somehow stuck in her arena, they can pick it up to continue\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter Six\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed wood grain of boats\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed wood grain of King Noob’s bridge\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed brick grain of the dilapidated “Guiding Newbies” building\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eReplaced outdated banners with worn Noob Royalty banners\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eFinale Lobby\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFog changed from white to orange\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed a bug that could send the entire lobby to Finale Talk\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eA Hop, Skip, and a Jump\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eBetter detection for controller users added (for instructions)\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eUnused scripts and UI elements deleted\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eSource Code\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe jetpack now calculates the exact force to give a player 60% gravity instead of assuming 1500 u/s - this should make every avatar consistent\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-4489518-h-02252021-patch-3-4\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-4489518-h-02252021-patch-3-4\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e02/25/2021 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#3\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u00