003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eDying with the “Car Keys” no longer removes them from a player’s inventory\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003ePlayers now spawn with inmate clothing for the entirety of the level\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003ePlayer hats are removed in order to make the prisoner hat fit better\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eJail cells revamped (added bedsheets, pickaxes, and debris)\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe police car now makes an engine sound when leaving the chapter\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded a new song into the music playlist\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eUnused music tracks removed\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eWood grain mostly fixed\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eMisc. material grain mostly fixed\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRemoved unused content from ReplicatedStorage for performance\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eMusic Credits\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded missing music tracks to the jukebox\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-4489518-h-02272021-patch-5-6\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-4489518-h-02272021-patch-5-6\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e02/27/2021 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#5\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eLobby\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eDisabled scraping several untranslatable strings for localization\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter One\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003ePicking up items can no longer “fail” (a player could pick up an item and not be n