3e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe objective UI now supports localization\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe objective UI now uses ViewportFrames instead of ImageLabels\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003ePrince + Princess Noob now use the new objective framework for their crowns\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eConverted improper RemoteFunctions into RemoteEvents\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRemoved unused RemoteFunctions\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter Four\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eLava movement is now client-side\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eFinale Lobby\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eShares matchmaking changes from the lobby\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eFinale Fight\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNoobs make oofing noises when slain to test if you have empathy\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNoobs have custom names again\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNoob health UI optimized\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNoob death scripts optimized - this results in the immediate enabling of the phase button when enough noobs are slain\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eDead noobs no longer have random body parts “freeze” in the air\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eNoob t-shirts are now HD\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eMoved stored enemies from ReplicatedStorage to ServerStorage\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eMoved stored healthpacks from ReplicatedStorage to ServerStorage\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRemoved unused content from ReplicatedStorage\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRemoved excessive legacy hat welds from Queen Noob\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eFifteen Minutes to Doomsday\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRewrote the code collection scripts, they should now be more consistent\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRewrote the keypad scripts\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eCorrectly guessing the keypad code without owning all of the code pieces gives a player 500 max health (one life only)\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eDisabled the ability to reset while in the starting cutscene\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eIt is no longer possible to jump off the ship during the starting cutscene\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdjusted triggers for the starting cutscene to prevent being locked outside of the ship\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAltered a line of dialog from the Corporal in order to have it fit better in a chat bubble\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e“Nubkins” is no longer capitalized in dialog as it is not a proper noun\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eCutscene NPCs now wear the same hats they wear after the cutscene\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded dynamic clouds\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-4489518-h-03012021-patch-7-8\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-4489518-h-03012021-patch-7-8\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e03/01/2021 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#7\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eLobby\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eParty UI moved to the top-center of screen if a device is touchscreen\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter One\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eCollected lost items are destroyed on the client\\u003c/li