imbs\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e“Destruct” now fires directly under a player while jumping\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e“Destruct” now makes a touchscreen players jump (to make blast jumping easier)\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e“Destruct” now has a 4x radius on touchscreen devices to make minesweeper possible with the above change\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-4489518-h-03122021-patch-12-13\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-4489518-h-03122021-patch-12-13\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e03/12/2021 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#12\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter Three\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed a bug that could result in Prince Noob getting stuck in a floor or wall\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed a bug that could result in Princess Noob getting stuck in a floor\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter Five\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed a rare softlock that could occur by slipping directly into the purple room’s pipe\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-4489518-h-03162021-patch-13-14\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-4489518-h-03162021-patch-13-14\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e03/16/2021 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#13\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eOverall\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eBug reports no longer go into the void if above 2048 characters\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eBug reports now require confirmation before submitting\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eJoke bug reports now face moderation action\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eLobby\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded a new VHS tape to simulate the moderated bug report experience\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-4489518-h-03172021-patch-14-15\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-4489518-h-03172021-patch-14-15\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e03/17/2021 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#14\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eOverall\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eDying from a deadly liquid now plays the SFX near the player instead of at the center of the liquid\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eLowered the range of ambient SFX to prevent hearing them from across the map\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter One\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eWorld SFX no longer weirdly cut off at a distance\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter Two\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eLowered lava by one stud to prevent accidental grazing\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eChapter Four\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eChanged the green liquid’s death SFX to something more lore-friendly\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u0