ot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/1st_place_medal.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:1st_place_medal:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:1st_place_medal:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e \\u003cstrong\\u003eThis update would not be possible without the contributions of \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/u/ramikawaii\\\&quot;\\u003eReniachii\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/dudemanextremer\\\&quot;\\u003e@dudemanextremer\\u003c/a\\u003e, and \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://soundcloud.com/cadence-hira\\\&quot; rel=\\\&quot;noopener nofollow ugc\\\&quot;\\u003eDJIVVI\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eOverall\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMETAVERSE CHAMPIONS TIME!\\u003c/strong\\u003e \\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/trophy.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:trophy:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:trophy:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/trophy.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:trophy:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:trophy:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/trophy.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:trophy:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:trophy:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAdded new free bonus chapter - “Ogg Vorbis”\\u003c/strong\\u003e (AKA TDTNTOR 2’s Metaverse Champions event)\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdditional strings scraped and localized\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eOgg Vorbis (Metaverse Champions)\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eObjective\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eTo earn \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/badges/2124672891/Metaverse-Champions-Sparks-Mystery-Box-4\\\&quot;\\u003eSparks’ Secret Package #4\\u003c/a\\u003e, you need to beat Ogg Vorbis before May 14th\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eCredits\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAll OST composed by \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://soundcloud.com/cadence-hira\\\&quot; rel=\\\&quot;noopener nofollow ugc\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDJIVVI\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e and \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/l_uxx\\\&quot;\\u003e@l_uxx\\u003c/a\\u003e - if you’re a content creator, you can keep that volume cranked up! \\u003cem\\u003e(NOTE: using the OST outside of an Ogg Vorbis playthrough will result in a DMCA takedown)\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eOgg Vorbis has full Spanish and Portuguese support thanks to \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/u/ramikawaii\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eReniachii\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e and \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/dudemanextremer\\\&quot;\\u003e@dudemanextremer\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eEverything, except OST and localization, by \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/cloakedyoshi\\\&quot;\\u003e@cloakedyoshi\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eSpecial thanks to the \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/groups/3055661/QA-Testers-of-Robloxia\\\&quot;\\u003eQA Testers of Robloxia\\u003c/a\\u003e - especially \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/mariodylan\\\&quot;\\u003e@mariodylan\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/diste\\\&quot;\\u003e@Diste\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/turtlepla\\\&quot;\\u003e@Turtlepla\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot;\\u003e@Roselius\\u003c/span\\u003e, and \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/vulkarin\\\&quot;\\u003e@Vulkarin\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eMisc\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eOgg Vorbis takes place in the universe of TDTNTOR 2 - that’s right, it’s 100% canon! Without spoiling too much, you get to witness something that happened in 2010 firsthand. Not only that, there’s some pretty neat foreshadowing.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eOgg Vorbis comes with 4 new badges! \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/badges/2124672891/Metaverse-Champions-Sparks-Mystery-Box-4\\\&quot;\\u003eOne is limited-time only\\u003c/a\\u003e, so make sure you earn it ASAP. \\u003cem\\u003eThere will be a title for this badge in the Badge Vault once it’s re-enabled.\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eLobby\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded a teleport door to for Ogg Vorbis\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded event décor throughout the lobby - can you find all four champions? Probably.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRemoved the “Mysterious Button”\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eThe Day the Noobs Took Over Roblox 3\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eWork has resumed on TDTNTOR 3 now that Ogg Vorbis is complete. This update has been three months in the making - I hope you enjoy it!\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eA friendly reminder that any fake bug reports for TDTNTOR 2 delay TDTNTOR 3 development by 400,000 years per fake bug report\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatches\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-5083316-h-05062021-patch-1-2\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-5083316-h-05062021-patch-1-2\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e05/06/2021 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#1\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eOgg Vorbis\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed a rare bug related to pathfinding in the final cutscene\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eElevator ascends at .5x the original speed to accommodate low-FPS physics jank\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eHatched Plan door changed to black glass (instead of orange neon) as players were confused and thought it was the exit\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eMusic Credits\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed the jukebox\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eReordered the jukebox’s tracklist\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded Ogg Vorbis OST\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-5083316-h-05072021-patch-2-3\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-5083316-h-05072021-patch-2-3\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e05/07/2021 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#2\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eOgg Vorbis\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u0