; title=\\\&quot;:eyes:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:eyes:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e \\u003cem\\u003eThis update is a multi-week update leading into yet another major update…\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSUPER INTENSE SCAVENGER HUNT TIME! \\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/mag.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:mag:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:mag:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e \\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/female_detective.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:female_detective:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:female_detective:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eEvery Friday at noon EST from today until December 10th - a mysterious artifact will appear in a chosen chapter!\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe mysterious artifacts will only appear in free chapters\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eCollect all six artifacts in order to play an upcoming bonus chapter on December 10th!\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eOverall\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eHighlights\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAdded the first mysterious artifact to an unknown chapter\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAdded six new badges, one for each mysterious artifact\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eBy default, mobile auto jumping is now disabled\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003