\&quot; data-dominant-color=\\\&quot;36502F\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/eyes.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:eyes:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:eyes:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e \\u003cem\\u003eThe conclusion to the OMINOUS Update is here…\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eI hope you’ve been collecting artifacts! \\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/mag.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:mag:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:mag:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e \\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/female_detective.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:female_detective:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:female_detective:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eIf you have all six, you can play the new bonus chapter for free! If not, there’s still time to earn them…\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eIf you’re lazy, \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/game-pass/25740346/Bonus-Chapter-The-Fate-of-Blink\\\&quot;\\u003eyou can buy access to the chapter\\u003c/a\\u003e! However, to respect our valiant artifact scavengers - it is priced at a lofty \\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/original/4X/a/d/b/adb6e6637175f53d2cac02a3bb32b2da33d9acb3.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:robux_light:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji emoji-custom\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:robux_light:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e499.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-6480705-update-log-2\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-6480705-update-log-2\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003eUpdate Log\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eOverall\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAdded a brand-new bonus chapter - “The Fate of Blink”\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe six mysterious artifacts will no longer be earnable after January 24th @ 11:59 AM PST\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eImplemented several small bug + performance fixes related to cutscenes\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eThe Fate of Blink \\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/eye.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:eye:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:eye:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDid you ever want a continuation of \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/game-pass/2854081/Bonus-Chapter-The-Fate-of-Agent-X14\\\&quot;\\u003eThe Fate of Agent X14\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWell, now it’s here, and there’s a small twist - you’re playing as someone else. She’s got some pretty unique abilities. Three badges, oodles of lore, several cutscenes, and a pretty epic boss fight. All in all, there’s a lot of new features in one chapter.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eSpecial thanks to \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/dogutsune\\\&quot;\\u003e@Dogutsune\\u003c/a\\u003e for their super awesome \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/library/4920233435/Dogu15-Rig-Update-3\\\&quot;\\u003eDogu15 Rig\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eDisclaimer \\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/warning.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:warning:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:warning:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThis chapter was coded VERY quickly. If you run into any softlocks/hardlocks, please let \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/cloakedyoshi\\\&quot;\\u003e@cloakedyoshi\\u003c/a\\u003e know ASAP.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eLet me know what you think! Is the chapter too easy, too hard, just right? Is it fun, is it boring, is it okay? Depending on feedback, future chapters may be more similar to this one!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eDialog/text/strings will be scraped and localized in an later patch\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eDifficulty rebalances, if needed, will come in a later patch\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatches\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-6480705-h-121221-patch-1-3\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-6480705-h-121221-patch-1-3\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e12/12/21 - Patch \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;hashtag-raw\\\&quot;\\u003e#1\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nPatch Notes\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eThe Fate of Blink\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eBalancing\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eBecause \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;spoiler\\\&quot;\\u003eBlink\\u003c/span\\u003e is a bit different, \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;spoiler\\\&quot;\\u003eshe\\u003c/span\\u003e now heals \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;spoiler\\\&quot;\\u003eher\\u003c/span\\u003e health at half the normal rate\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;spoiler\\\&quot;\\u003eBlink Bot\\u003c/span\\u003e now attacks progressively faster the more you damage them\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eCapped the max damage dealt to \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;spoiler\\\&quot;\\u003eBlink Bot\\u003c/span\\u003e at 33 HP instead of 50 HP - 50 HP was possible, but very difficult and janky to achieve\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eReduced “Familiar Face” forcefield time from 5 seconds to 2 seconds\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eBug Fixes + Performance\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe “Skip Cutscene” button will now only appear once all essential assets have loaded\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe “Skip Cutscene” button will now always function as intended\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed an unintended softlock where Toothy Deer Man could be used as a shield from the retracting trash compactor, leaving the player to ponder their existence for all eternity\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed a bug where lily pads could become visually desynced when minimizing Roblox\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe radio easter egg now uses the “F” key instead of the “E” key for its ProximityPrompt\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eThe “Familiar Places” spawn is now invisible\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed a rare bug that could allow for rapid instant attacks against the boss\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eGeysers and boulders no longer persist after \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;spoiler\\\&quot;\\u003eBlink Bot\\u003c/span\\u003e’s death\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed a small typo in \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;spoiler\\\&quot;\\u003eScarlett\\u003c/span\\u003e’s dialog in the closing cutscene\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003ePolishing + QoL\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eThe sprint ability is now a toggle on touchscreen devices - this means you no longer have to hold down the button to sprint\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eThe turtle tunnel is now client-side - this ideally means it will be easier on devices with low FPS or weaker internet connection\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eImplemented a sneaky solution to hide chat bubbles at the end of the first cutscene\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRemoved an unfitting song from the tutorial area\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded several additional truss ladders to the “A Hop, Skip, and a Jump” area to make traversal easier\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFixed a small visual clipping issue for a wall in the “Quick Uptake” area\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded a few additional NPC animations during dialog sequences\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;spoiler\\\&quot;\\u003eAgent X14\\u003c/span\\u003e’s final wave animation has been changed to keep \\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;spoiler\\\&quot;\\u003ehis\\u003c/span\\u003e dialog easy to read\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eMusic Credits\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded the song from the Music Credits to the tracklist\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAdded the music from The Fate of Blink to the tracklist\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eImproved the code for the jukebox\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-6480705-h-010222-patch-2-4\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&qu